# The raw OpenHistoricalMap download (QUEUE 0v): 220 MB of Overpass responses,
# rebuilt by `node scripts/fetch-ohm-source.mjs`. The built snapshots under
# client/public/map-data/ohm/ ARE committed, and manifest.json records every
# relation id, name, lifetime and wikidata id that went into them — so the input
# is identified and reproducible without vendoring it. OHM is versioned, so a
# re-fetch can be compared against that manifest.
server/data/map/source/ohm/raw/
